  "title": "Real physicalism entails panpsychism",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "d3657d83-1615-4ed1-916c-5bfea0d55f7a",
      "text": "Real physicalists must give up the thesis that physical stuff is wholly non-experiential in its fundamental nature. Given that radical emergence is impossible, real physicalism entails panpsychism, and the only alternative is substance dualism.",
